ự thảo Luật Thi h&agrave;nh &aacute;n h&igrave;nh sự sửa đổi, bổ sung; Nghị định số 49/2020/NĐ-CP ng&agrave;y 17/4/2020 của Ch&iacute;nh phủ quy định chi tiết thi h&agrave;nh Luật Thi h&agrave;nh &aacute;n h&igrave;nh sự về t&aacute;i h&ograve;a nhập cộng đồng; c&aacute;c</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;t</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">h&ocirc;ng tư</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">hướng dẫn</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">của c&aacute;c bộ, ban, ng&agrave;nh</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;c&oacute; li&ecirc;n quan c&ocirc;ng t&aacute;c thi h&agrave;nh &aacute;n h&igrave;nh sự tại cộng đồng, t&aacute;i h&ograve;a nhập cộng đồng.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 1rem; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; color: rgb(18, 18, 18); font-family: Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: justify;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/UserFile/editor/images/screenshot_1762846614.jpeg\"></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 1rem; paddi